index 0000000..33a14c6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/contracts-prerequisites/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Fixed Contracts prerequisites
+
+This packet transports only two unchanged, package-owner-approved archives to the existing owners' `release.yml` / `production` NuGet trusted-publishing identities. It is not a family release, runtime activation, or application acceptance.
+
+The requesting package owner approved the exact source, coordinate and archive proposal, then explicitly approved this prerequisite-only publication profile (`approval.json`). The existing normal release jobs keep their exact full CI/G-6/commitlint, full package inventory and container gates. The new profile requires these package-only qualifications rather than the circular full-application prerequisites.
+
+* EventStore.Contracts5.3.0: source0be0c922883d4ea61b18e843e24472162261d934, Builds e2bbbd0893f586e4d447ef8358ff747ea3d34435. Full Contracts tests1704/1704 and the unchanged14-family API gate passed; the approved Contracts archive was inserted in that fixture inventory. An earlier fixture-incomplete52-failure run remains retained in the original evidence and is superseded by this complete owner qualification.
+* Projects.Contracts2.0.0-story66.3: historical source5b4bdeacde318a1d948db7ef76843df0c548f084 and Builds801f268cd1b37ecae41d4fb20d115c055b4c5793. The original archive is unchanged;119 source files match and the historical rebuild has identical CLR metadata/method bodies after the narrowly recorded PE/PDB normalization. Pinned McpCli5008de388c5e37257ca78e48d8afe899cf7aaa2a restores, builds Release with warnings as errors and discovers all four Projects operations strictly. No current-source repackaging is allowed.
+* Exact EventStore archive consumer: current Projects source0bb322c2105c841eba150fd6cb5aab2b3d4b2d4c builds Contracts and passes207/207 Contracts tests with the Contracts-only pin correction. Other dependency pins remain unchanged.
+
+`manifest.json` binds the approved archive bytes, all payload entry bytes and original qualification receipts. The program hard-codes the two approved coordinates/source/archive hashes, checks every receipt and refuses altered archives. It executes no module code and never repacks. Upload uses nuget.org only and the existing owner OIDC account. Public repository signature verification and identical payload entries (only `.signature.p7s` added) are required after upload; failed or ambiguous uploads are retained and never automatically retried within a run.
+
+The prior full Projects build retains13 independent Conversations/generator API errors. Native B4/V1 fixtures and routing/main acceptance remain unqualified. Publication does not claim these gates passed. Fresh exact-delivery CI/G-6 is required after the pin correction, and subsequent failures must remain visible. No deployments, v2 activation or Story1.17 tracking change is authorized.

